{"id": "en-ja:1", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Hey everyone, thanks for joining the stream tonight!", "ref": "みなさん、今夜は配信に来てくれてありがとう！"}
{"id": "en-ja:2", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Can you hear me okay, or is my mic too quiet?", "ref": "声はちゃんと聞こえますか？それともマイクの音が小さすぎますか？"}
{"id": "en-ja:3", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "I'll be right back, I need to grab some water.", "ref": "すぐ戻ります、ちょっと水を取ってきます。"}
{"id": "en-ja:4", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "That boss fight was way harder than I expected.", "ref": "あのボス戦は思っていたよりずっと難しかった。"}
{"id": "en-ja:5", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Let's meet at the main plaza in five minutes.", "ref": "5分後にメインの広場で会いましょう。"}
{"id": "en-ja:6", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Does anyone know how to get to the next area?", "ref": "次のエリアへの行き方を知っている人はいますか？"}
{"id": "en-ja:7", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "I think my internet is lagging a little bit.", "ref": "ネットが少しラグっている気がします。"}
{"id": "en-ja:8", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Thank you so much for the follow, welcome!", "ref": "フォローありがとうございます、ようこそ！"}
{"id": "en-ja:9", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "We should take a group photo before we leave.", "ref": "帰る前にみんなで集合写真を撮ろうよ。"}
{"id": "en-ja:10", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Sorry, I didn't catch that. Could you say it again?", "ref": "ごめん、聞き取れなかった。もう一度言ってもらえますか？"}
{"id": "en-ja:11", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "This world has really beautiful music.", "ref": "このワールドは音楽が本当にきれいですね。"}
{"id": "en-ja:12", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "I'm going to switch avatars, give me a second.", "ref": "アバターを変えるので、ちょっと待ってください。"}
{"id": "en-ja:13", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Watch out, there's someone behind you!", "ref": "気をつけて、後ろに誰かいるよ！"}
{"id": "en-ja:14", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "My favorite food is ramen, especially in winter.", "ref": "好きな食べ物はラーメンで、特に冬に食べるのが好きです。"}
{"id": "en-ja:15", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "It's almost midnight here, so I should go to sleep soon.", "ref": "こっちはもうすぐ夜中の12時なので、そろそろ寝ないと。"}
{"id": "en-ja:16", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Can you invite me to your instance?", "ref": "あなたのインスタンスに招待してもらえますか？"}
{"id": "en-ja:17", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "The new update added a lot of cool features.", "ref": "新しいアップデートでかっこいい機能がたくさん追加された。"}
{"id": "en-ja:18", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "I've been learning Japanese for about two years.", "ref": "日本語を勉強して2年くらいになります。"}
{"id": "en-ja:19", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Please be kind to each other in the chat.", "ref": "チャットではお互いに優しくしてください。"}
{"id": "en-ja:20", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Let's try again, I'm sure we can win this time.", "ref": "もう一回やってみよう、今度はきっと勝てるよ。"}
{"id": "en-ja:21", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "What time is it where you live?", "ref": "あなたの住んでいるところは今何時ですか？"}
{"id": "en-ja:22", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "I really like your outfit, where did you get it?", "ref": "その服すごくいいね、どこで手に入れたの？"}
{"id": "en-ja:23", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "The event starts tomorrow at eight in the evening.", "ref": "イベントは明日の夜8時に始まります。"}
{"id": "en-ja:24", "source": "en", "target": "ja", "src": "Good night everyone, see you next time!", "ref": "みなさんおやすみなさい、また次回！"}
