{"id": "es-en:11", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Este mundo tiene una música realmente hermosa.", "ref": "This world has really beautiful music."}
{"id": "es-en:12", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Voy a cambiar de avatar, dame un segundo.", "ref": "I'm going to switch avatars, give me a second."}
{"id": "es-en:13", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "¡Cuidado, hay alguien detrás de ti!", "ref": "Watch out, there's someone behind you!"}
{"id": "es-en:14", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Mi comida favorita es el ramen, sobre todo en invierno.", "ref": "My favorite food is ramen, especially in winter."}
{"id": "es-en:15", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Aquí ya es casi medianoche, así que debería irme a dormir pronto.", "ref": "It's almost midnight here, so I should go to sleep soon."}
{"id": "es-en:16", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "¿Me puedes invitar a tu instancia?", "ref": "Can you invite me to your instance?"}
{"id": "es-en:17", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "La nueva actualización añadió muchas funciones geniales.", "ref": "The new update added a lot of cool features."}
{"id": "es-en:18", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Llevo unos dos años aprendiendo japonés.", "ref": "I've been learning Japanese for about two years."}
{"id": "es-en:19", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Por favor, sean amables unos con otros en el chat.", "ref": "Please be kind to each other in the chat."}
{"id": "es-en:20", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Intentémoslo otra vez, seguro que esta vez ganamos.", "ref": "Let's try again, I'm sure we can win this time."}
{"id": "es-en:21", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "¿Qué hora es donde vives?", "ref": "What time is it where you live?"}
{"id": "es-en:22", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "Me encanta tu ropa, ¿dónde la conseguiste?", "ref": "I really like your outfit, where did you get it?"}
{"id": "es-en:23", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "El evento empieza mañana a las ocho de la noche.", "ref": "The event starts tomorrow at eight in the evening."}
{"id": "es-en:24", "source": "es", "target": "en", "src": "¡Buenas noches a todos, nos vemos la próxima vez!", "ref": "Good night everyone, see you next time!"}
{"id": "en-zh:1", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Hey everyone, thanks for joining the stream tonight!", "ref": "大家好，谢谢你们今晚来看直播！"}
{"id": "en-zh:2", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Can you hear me okay, or is my mic too quiet?", "ref": "你们能听清楚我说话吗？还是我的麦克风声音太小了？"}
{"id": "en-zh:3", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "I'll be right back, I need to grab some water.", "ref": "我马上回来，我去拿点水。"}
{"id": "en-zh:4", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "That boss fight was way harder than I expected.", "ref": "那场Boss战比我想象的难多了。"}
{"id": "en-zh:5", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Let's meet at the main plaza in five minutes.", "ref": "我们五分钟后在主广场见吧。"}
{"id": "en-zh:6", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Does anyone know how to get to the next area?", "ref": "有人知道怎么去下一个区域吗？"}
{"id": "en-zh:7", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "I think my internet is lagging a little bit.", "ref": "我觉得我的网有点卡。"}
{"id": "en-zh:8", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Thank you so much for the follow, welcome!", "ref": "非常感谢关注，欢迎！"}
{"id": "en-zh:9", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "We should take a group photo before we leave.", "ref": "我们走之前应该拍张合影。"}
{"id": "en-zh:10", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Sorry, I didn't catch that. Could you say it again?", "ref": "抱歉，我没听清。你能再说一遍吗？"}
{"id": "en-zh:11", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "This world has really beautiful music.", "ref": "这个世界的音乐真的很好听。"}
{"id": "en-zh:12", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "I'm going to switch avatars, give me a second.", "ref": "我要换个模型，等我一下。"}
{"id": "en-zh:13", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Watch out, there's someone behind you!", "ref": "小心，你后面有人！"}
{"id": "en-zh:14", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "My favorite food is ramen, especially in winter.", "ref": "我最喜欢的食物是拉面，尤其是在冬天。"}
{"id": "en-zh:15", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "It's almost midnight here, so I should go to sleep soon.", "ref": "我这边快半夜了，所以我应该快去睡觉了。"}
{"id": "en-zh:16", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Can you invite me to your instance?", "ref": "你能邀请我去你的房间吗？"}
{"id": "en-zh:17", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "The new update added a lot of cool features.", "ref": "新的更新加了很多很酷的功能。"}
{"id": "en-zh:18", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "I've been learning Japanese for about two years.", "ref": "我学日语大概两年了。"}
{"id": "en-zh:19", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Please be kind to each other in the chat.", "ref": "请大家在聊天里互相友善一点。"}
{"id": "en-zh:20", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Let's try again, I'm sure we can win this time.", "ref": "我们再试一次吧，我相信这次一定能赢。"}
{"id": "en-zh:21", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "What time is it where you live?", "ref": "你那边现在几点？"}
{"id": "en-zh:22", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "I really like your outfit, where did you get it?", "ref": "我很喜欢你的衣服，你在哪里买的？"}
{"id": "en-zh:23", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "The event starts tomorrow at eight in the evening.", "ref": "活动明天晚上八点开始。"}
{"id": "en-zh:24", "source": "en", "target": "zh", "src": "Good night everyone, see you next time!", "ref": "大家晚安，下次见！"}
